# roadmap 4.4: player 1 enters initials (AAA, 01/01: initials_probe.lua), so the game keeps a
# record for them, and plays a game to its end. Forcing hidden players, player 1 among them
# (Divita), leaves the NVRAM after the audit area exactly as without them. Whether this short
# game (it ends after the first quarter with player 1 idle) already saved AAA's record is not
# shown here; what is shown is that the forced players change nothing in that area.
script dist/NBAJamRecomp/mods/unlock_players.lua
extra initials_probe.lua
game nbajamte nbajamse
frames 59001
run player1=0
run player1=23 player2=55 player3=1 player4=99
once initials entered at frame 1939
nbajamte: once records area 7f4f43d8
nbajamse: once records area 96d3bf69
